{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:PredictedSpectra.ChebyshevTorusCoefficients","@type":"LeanModule","name":"PredictedSpectra.ChebyshevTorusCoefficients","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Polynomial.Laurent"],"declarations":8,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.chebyshev_succ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.chebyshev_succ","kind":"theorem","line":58,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/chebyshev-torus-coefficients.lean#L58-L64","doc":"The recurrence holds by definition. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.chebyshev_base","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.chebyshev_base","kind":"theorem","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/chebyshev-torus-coefficients.lean#L55-L56","doc":"Base case: the bare crossing `T_{2,1}` has `(c_1, d_1) = (1, 0)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.dCoeff","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.dCoeff","kind":"def","line":52,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/chebyshev-torus-coefficients.lean#L52-L53","doc":"The `d_n` component. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.cCoeff","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.cCoeff","kind":"def","line":49,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/chebyshev-torus-coefficients.lean#L49-L50","doc":"The `c_n` component. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.chebyshevTorusCoefficients","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.chebyshevTorusCoefficients","kind":"def","line":38,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/chebyshev-torus-coefficients.lean#L38-L47","doc":"The Chebyshev crossing coefficients `(c_n, d_n)` of `T_{2,n}`, defined by\nthe recurrence `c_{n+1} = c_n (q - q⁻¹) + c_n + d_n`, `d_{n+1} = c_n`,\nwith base case `(c_1, d_1) = (1, 0)`.  Indexed so that `n = 0` returns\nthe trivial `(0, 0)` and `n = 1` the bare crossing `(1, 0)`. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:def:chebyshev-torus-coefficients","label":"def:chebyshev-torus-coefficients","md":"quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/chebyshev-torus-coefficients.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.qInvParam","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.qInvParam","kind":"def","line":35,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/chebyshev-torus-coefficients.lean#L35-L36","doc":"The inverse indeterminate `q⁻¹`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.qParam","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.qParam","kind":"def","line":32,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/chebyshev-torus-coefficients.lean#L32-L33","doc":"The indeterminate `q`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.R_q","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.R_q","kind":"def","line":29,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/chebyshev-torus-coefficients.lean#L29-L30","doc":"Ground ring `R_q = ℤ[q, q⁻¹]`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}